        <mxCell id="e56" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#8a8a8a;endArrow=blockThin;endFill=1;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="n53" target="n55">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n57" value="&amp;#9201; &lt;b&gt;only one boundary is exposed&lt;/b&gt; &amp;#8212; when it started speaking.&lt;br&gt;Hebrew forces their slowest TTS model." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=12;align=left;spacingLeft=10;verticalAlign=middle;arcSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1100" y="656" width="440" height="84" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n58" value="&lt;b&gt;YOUR LEVERS, IN ORDER OF EFFECT&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;1. Payload size.&lt;/b&gt; One rank_airports call returned 13.5 KB (~3,400 tokens) the model had to read before opening its mouth. VOICE_ADDENDUM + topN 3 &amp;#8594; 4.3 KB, a 68% cut. Biggest lever there was, and 100% yours.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;2. Architecture.&lt;/b&gt; Native vs cascade is a ~4&amp;#215; gap. Choosable, not tunable.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;3. Turn detection.&lt;/b&gt; A wasted turn costs seconds; tuning costs milliseconds. A 200 ms VAD split one question into four fragments; turn_eagerness=eager lost 34 s in one session.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;4. TTS model choice.&lt;/b&gt; Hebrew locks ElevenLabs to its slowest model; English swaps at connect time.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;NOT YOURS:&lt;/b&gt; STT, LLM and TTS inference time. Note the engine is never the bottleneck &amp;#8212; runTool is a pure in-memory lookup over JSON loaded once." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#999999;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=10;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=8;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="60" y="940" width="1480" height="210" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
